(6751663, 1011735, 10785, '<td valign="top">What kid doesn''t like exploring, especially along the river bank! I like the sentiment here. I think the photo is a beautiful reflection of the sunset. You did a great job getting the light in the sky and reflection exposed well.<br/> <br/>I think the river bank could be a made brighter to bring out some more of the detail. My eye goes right past the darker river bank into the bright orange setting sun.</td>', 'What kid doesn''t like exploring, especially along the river bank! I like the sentiment here. I think the photo is a beautiful reflection of the sunset. You did a great job getting the light in the sky and reflection exposed well. I think the river bank could be a made brighter to bring out some more of the detail. My eye goes right past the darker river bank into the bright orange setting sun.', '2012-04-25 14:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6751665, 1011729, 10785, '<td valign="top">Lovely! It would make a great greeting card. Very nice sentiment. I like the tonal range from blue to bright orange, then the silhouetted tree and foreground is great. Nice placement of the horizon. I love tree shots!</td>', 'Lovely! It would make a great greeting card. Very nice sentiment. I like the tonal range from blue to bright orange, then the silhouetted tree and foreground is great. Nice placement of the horizon. I love tree shots!', '2012-04-25 14:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6751666, 1011473, 10785, '<td valign="top">Cute! Your DoF is spot on here. It is amazing how small the plane of focus is. Seeing how the tail is slightly OOF, you nailed the focus point!</td>', 'Cute! Your DoF is spot on here. It is amazing how small the plane of focus is. Seeing how the tail is slightly OOF, you nailed the focus point!', '2012-04-25 14:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6751668, 1011492, 10785, '<td valign="top">Love the girls eyes! Monkeys are funny! You are right on the edge with that shutter speed managing to capture the monkeys face nice and sharp where there is slight motion blur on the rest of him.</td>', 'Love the girls eyes! Monkeys are funny! You are right on the edge with that shutter speed managing to capture the monkeys face nice and sharp where there is slight motion blur on the rest of him.', '2012-04-25 14:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
