(6752399, 1011646, 60173, '<td valign="top">I really hope this does well, but I fear because of its subtlety it may not score as well as it should. I''m not even sure how I''m calling it subtle, but I initially did skip over it, said "whoa, rewind", and came right back. <br/> <br/>You''ve created a fantastical dreamy story. I''m usually not a fan of having stuffed stuff (little mouse) in an image, but this absolutely makes sense to have it in this usage. It is absolutely what child stories and dreams are made of. There''s enough creativity and detail in this image that a child could see this and their mind would spend the rest of the day creating the rest of the story. Exactly what a child stuck in a boring hospital might need. Clearly, these noble heroes are off on a crazy adventure, and I hope Dallas joins them.</td>', 'I really hope this does well, but I fear because of its subtlety it may not score as well as it should. I''m not even sure how I''m calling it subtle, but I initially did skip over it, said "whoa, rewind", and came right back.  You''ve created a fantastical dreamy story. I''m usually not a fan of having stuffed stuff (little mouse) in an image, but this absolutely makes sense to have it in this usage. It is absolutely what child stories and dreams are made of. There''s enough creativity and detail in this image that a child could see this and their mind would spend the rest of the day creating the rest of the story. Exactly what a child stuck in a boring hospital might need. Clearly, these noble heroes are off on a crazy adventure, and I hope Dallas joins them.', '2012-04-26 12:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
