(6753144, 1010937, 138630, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this one personally, and I''ll bet Dallas will, too.  When my kids were young, we visited the modern art museum in Brussels, Belgium.  They had a blast standing back and guessing the names of the art works.  Then we would step forward to read them.  When they had the title "right" (like "Three Balls on a Zigzag"), they felt soooo smart.  When they were "wrong", they stood back and re-evaluated, often seeing the work in a completely new way because the artist''s title had re-focused their attention.  I hope this one does well with the voters, but that doesn''t matter really - I do think it will score with Dallas.  Voting later.</td>', 'I LOVE this one personally, and I''ll bet Dallas will, too.  When my kids were young, we visited the modern art museum in Brussels, Belgium.  They had a blast standing back and guessing the names of the art works.  Then we would step forward to read them.  When they had the title "right" (like "Three Balls on a Zigzag"), they felt soooo smart.  When they were "wrong", they stood back and re-evaluated, often seeing the work in a completely new way because the artist''s title had re-focused their attention.  I hope this one does well with the voters, but that doesn''t matter really - I do think it will score with Dallas.  Voting later.', '2012-04-27 10:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
