(6757667, 1011646, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Brent_S:</b></div><hr/><i> Awesome! Given the reason behind this topic being picked I think this type of image is perfect for the task and you did a masterful job Christophe. I''m sure Dallas will be thrilled with this one :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks a lot Brent :-) I really hope he we like it, since a 20x30" framed canvas of it is going his way, to try and bring some fun in his room!</td>', 'Originally posted by Brent_S: Awesome! Given the reason behind this topic being picked I think this type of image is perfect for the task and you did a masterful job Christophe. I''m sure Dallas will be thrilled with this one :)   Thanks a lot Brent :-) I really hope he we like it, since a 20x30" framed canvas of it is going his way, to try and bring some fun in his room!', '2012-05-02 11:16:30.000000', NULL, 0),
