(6757934, 1011646, 65319, '<td valign="top">I know I''m one of the very few people who do not connect very well with your imagery in general.  But, this particular image reveled in the spirit of this challenge and I absolutely loved it (for whatever that is worth to you with so many fans...;-)...).  The joy of a little boy''s heart abounds in this image and I hope Dallas just loves it the most.</td>', 'I know I''m one of the very few people who do not connect very well with your imagery in general.  But, this particular image reveled in the spirit of this challenge and I absolutely loved it (for whatever that is worth to you with so many fans...;-)...).  The joy of a little boy''s heart abounds in this image and I hope Dallas just loves it the most.', '2012-05-02 14:58:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6757947, 1011644, 54645, '<td valign="top">Yes, an under-appreciated image. . . nothing better than a nap in the good light! I''m glad Don tagged it, I may not have come back.</td>', 'Yes, an under-appreciated image. . . nothing better than a nap in the good light! I''m glad Don tagged it, I may not have come back.', '2012-05-02 15:01:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6757948, 1011368, 65319, '<td valign="top">Be careful...your frogs are going to end up as fat and spoiled as Wendy''s squirrels!  I''m pouting because I thought for sure this one would end up on the front page.  Well done, Lydia!</td>', 'Be careful...your frogs are going to end up as fat and spoiled as Wendy''s squirrels!  I''m pouting because I thought for sure this one would end up on the front page.  Well done, Lydia!', '2012-05-02 15:02:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6757966, 1011635, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I really think an exception to the text rule should have been made here.</td>', 'Great photo.  I really think an exception to the text rule should have been made here.', '2012-05-02 15:22:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6757975, 1011144, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dennisheckman:</b></div><hr/><i> Gosh, why this image would receive 2-1''s and 4-4''s is just nuts. It''s a fantasy ride in itself. We constructed and thought out. Congrats on 9th place, but I thought it should be much higher. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This was a special challenge and I can''t complain. On the other hand I must say that I''m really proud of my image and I don''t understand how I could get so many low votes. And above all my score dropped 0.15 in the last few hours. All I can say is an italian sentence I already used before: l''invidia è una brutta bestia :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Dennisheckman: Gosh, why this image would receive 2-1''s and 4-4''s is just nuts. It''s a fantasy ride in itself. We constructed and thought out. Congrats on 9th place, but I thought it should be much higher.   This was a special challenge and I can''t complain. On the other hand I must say that I''m really proud of my image and I don''t understand how I could get so many low votes. And above all my score dropped 0.15 in the last few hours. All I can say is an italian sentence I already used before: l''invidia è una brutta bestia :)', '2012-05-02 15:27:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6757994, 1011646, 59029, '<td valign="top">Wonderful work as always, Christophe!  Not surprised that the hero''s mount is a Maine Coon, we had one growing up and nothing bothered him.  Now if only I can get my Birmans to look as heroic...;-)  Huge congrats on the blue!</td>', 'Wonderful work as always, Christophe!  Not surprised that the hero''s mount is a Maine Coon, we had one growing up and nothing bothered him.  Now if only I can get my Birmans to look as heroic...;-)  Huge congrats on the blue!', '2012-05-02 15:38:50.000000', NULL, 0),
